{"_meta":{"com.oxinsider/docs-group":"traders","securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["read"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get Trader P&L Time Series"},"description":"Get a trader's sports and esports daily P&L time series and pre-derived stats. Returns entries (daily realized P&L and its running sum), period stats (all/90d/30d/7d), monthly aggregation, per-year totals, the drawdown series, series_status, and realized: how the days add up to the wallet's Sports P&L.\n\nA day's daily_change is the realized P&L of the wallet's sports and esports markets dated to that UTC day (the resolution day, else the last trade day), so the days plus realized.undated_pnl equal realized.realized_pnl, the Sports P&L on the trader object. series_status pending means the series is not computed yet: entries are empty and never mean zero. A resolved trader with no sports or esports day returns an empty structured object (HTTP 200); an unknown address returns not found.\n\nArgs:\n  - address (string, required): Wallet address (0x...), username, or trd_-prefixed trader id\n  - from / to (string, optional): Inclusive UTC calendar dates (YYYY-MM-DD) bounding the daily series (entries and drawdown); stats, monthly and year_totals stay defined over the full history\n  - sections (string[], optional): Which sections to return: \"entries\", \"stats\", \"monthly\", \"year_totals\", \"drawdown\"; omit for all five. A section left out is absent, and an unrecognized name is an error, never ignored\n\nReturns: Structured trader P&L object (entries, stats, monthly, year_totals, drawdown, freshness_at, series_status, realized). A request that sent from, to or sections also carries view: the bounds applied, the sections present, entries_total, entries_in_window and the pre-window anchor.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"address":{"description":"Wallet address (0x...), username, or trd_-prefixed trader id","maxLength":100,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"from":{"description":"Inclusive UTC calendar-date lower bound (YYYY-MM-DD) for the daily series (entries and drawdown); omit for the whole stored history. Does not change stats, monthly or year_totals","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"sections":{"description":"Which sections of the object to return; omit for all five. A section left out is absent from the result, never null or empty","items":{"enum":["entries","stats","monthly","year_totals","drawdown"],"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"to":{"description":"Inclusive UTC calendar-date upper bound (YYYY-MM-DD) for the daily series (entries and drawdown); omit for the whole stored history. Must not be before from","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"}},"required":["address"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_trader_pnl","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"ResponseMeta":{"properties":{"cache_age_s":{"type":"integer"},"cached":{"type":"boolean"},"category_skill_base_payload_hash":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"category_skill_enriched_base_payload_hash":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"category_skill_model_operationally_degraded":{"type":"boolean"},"category_skill_model_version":{"type":"string"},"category_skill_observation_started_at":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"category_skill_platform":{"const":"polymarket","type":"string"},"category_skill_scope":{"const":"observed_goldsky_primary_taker_fill","type":"string"},"category_skill_source":{"enum":["live","partial","degraded","unavailable"],"type":"string"},"category_skill_source_coverage":{"enum":["partial_whale_threshold_fills","graded_wallet_fills"],"type":"string"},"category_skill_status_counts":{"properties":{"degraded":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"insufficient":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"live":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"stale":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"unknown":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["live","insufficient"